000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.          TRPTUSE.
000400 AUTHOR.              C HILLES.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.        MAY 1990.
000600 DATE-COMPILED.
000700*INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
000800*REMARKS.   TEST FILE OVERRIDES/FILE POINTERS/FILE BUFFERS.
000900*
001000*    THIS SAMPLE PROGRAM PROVES THAT AN OVERIDED SHARE(*YES)
001100*    - SHARE OPEN DATA PATH - CAUSES A SUBPROGRAM TO CHANGE BOTH
001200*    THE FILE POINTER AND FILE BUFFER IN THE CALLING PROGRAM.
006800 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
006900 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
007500 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
007600 FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT MPLTINFO-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

008000 DATA DIVISION.
008100 FILE SECTION.
008200
       FD  MPLTINFO-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0500  OF MCFLCS0501.

010600 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  SUB                          PIC 9(1).
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1            PIC X  VALUE "0".
           05  FILE-STATUS-2            PIC X  VALUE "0".

       COPY MPLT0 IN COPYCSIS.

052400 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
052600 1-HOUSEKEEPING.
           OPEN INPUT MPLTINFO-I.
           MOVE ZERO TO SUB.

           MOVE SPACES TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           START MPLTINFO-I KEY >= PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-REC-I
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
078200         DISPLAY "START ERROR"
078300         GO TO 6990-MAIN-X.

      *------ THE FIRST THREE RECORDS OF MPLTINFO ARE:
      *------    *006
      *------    *026
      *------    *032
       6000-READ-LOOP.
           ADD 1 TO SUB.
           IF SUB > 8
               GO TO 6990-MAIN-X.

           READ MPLTINFO-I NEXT INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               GO TO 6990-MAIN-X.

           DISPLAY "AFTER READ, MPLTINFO-KEY = ", MPLTINFO-KEY,
             " PLTINFOKEY = ", PLTINFOKEY.

      *------ CTSTOVERID DOES A DIRECT READ OF *006
           CALL "CTSTOVERID".
           DISPLAY "AFTER SUBPROGRAM, MPLTINFO-KEY = ",
             MPLTINFO-KEY, " PLTINFOKEY = ", PLTINFOKEY.

           GO TO 6000-READ-LOOP.

       6990-MAIN-X.
           CLOSE MPLTINFO-I.
           GOBACK.
